            "review_title": "Review at Deli Cafe",
            "review_text": "Kees S\nQingdao3 contributions\n0\nGreat place to stay in Ho Chi Minh, despite the rain.\nAug 2023 • Business\nI was here for several days and enjoyed both lunch, dinner and drinks in the evening.\nThe portions they serve were rather big for me, but the quality was good. And they seem to find a reason for free drinks all the time. If it's not happy hour (two for the price of one), then it's buy one, get two because of independence day. Or at least get 50% discount on the second drinks k at any time.\nThis was my first time in Vietnam, and I'm pleasantly surprised about the service and compassion of the hotel staff.\nRead more\nWritten September 1, 2023",
